QUERY NAME: qryProjectYearsCost
---------------------------------------------
TYPE: SELECT

SQL:
SELECT MY_ProjectMonthFinal.Year, MY_ProjectMonthFinal.Project, Sum(MY_ProjectMonthFinal.TotalCost) AS SumOfTotalCost
FROM MY_ProjectMonthFinal
GROUP BY MY_ProjectMonthFinal.Year, MY_ProjectMonthFinal.Project
HAVING (((MY_ProjectMonthFinal.Year)=2008));

